            "content": "# Knowledge Work\n\nThis private workspace is ready for offline document and spreadsheet work.\n\nUse `/opt/portal/office-check` to inspect the installed headless Office tools. Use `/opt/portal/office-convert` to create a PDF or recalculated spreadsheet copy; the helper preserves originals.\n\nThis image has no desktop session or browser viewer. It has no runtime network access.\n"
